# Update Project Status

When you complete a feature, fix, or significant change:

1. Open [PROJECT_STATUS.md](PROJECT_STATUS.md)
2. Update the "Last updated" date
3. Add new capabilities under "What's Built" or move items from "What's Missing" to "What's Built"
4. Remove completed items from "Pending Tasks" if that section exists
5. If you introduced new debt or resolved debt, update "Technical Debt and Liabilities" and "Debt Level"
6. Be concise; one-line entries are fine
